menu "WT99P461-S1 companion diagnostics"
    config WT_C61_ALLOC_TRACE
        bool "Record failed allocator caller sites"
        default n
        help
            Diagnostic builds only. Record up to eight failed call sites using
            bounded, allocation-free wrappers and the IDF 5.5.5 Wi-Fi OS adapter.
            Does not change allocation results or reset failure counters.
endmenu
